  m_text: Before you head off on your grand adventure, you should probably have a
    proper weapon. Luckily, I happen to have just the thing! There's only one little
    problem... I seem to have left my sword at the blacksmith's shop. Go find the
    blacksmith and tell him I sent you. He should have the sword waiting for you.
    Take it, and then you'll be ready to face whatever dangers lie ahead.
